  <AltText>
    Sprite of our headmate, Rinith. They are an axolotl-kobold hybrid with pink skin/scales, pink gill, dark pink horns, and a pink tail with dark pink scales running down its length, as well as light pink fins. They have red hair, and eyes where the right eye is a dark red and the left eye is a dark yellow. They're wearing a purple layered dress and a translucent blue plaid skirt.
